;&#8204;&nbsp;&#8204;&nbsp;&#8204;&nbsp;&#8204;&nbsp;&#8204;&nbsp;&#8204;&nbsp;&#8204;&nbsp;&#8204;&nbsp;&#8204;&nbsp;&#8204;&nbsp;&#8204;&nbsp;&#8204;&nbsp;&#8204;&nbsp;&#8204;&nbsp;&#8204;&nbsp;&#8204;&nbsp;&#8204;&nbsp;&#8204;&nbsp;&#8204;&nbsp;&#8204;&nbsp;</div><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" class=\"outer\" style=\"background-color:#05050a;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td align=\"center\"><!--[if mso]><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"640\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\"><tr><td><![endif]--><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:640px;background-color:#05050a;border-collapse:collapse;table-layout:fixed\"><tr><td class=\"pad\" style=\"padding:28px 48px 0;background-color:#05050a\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"  style=\"border-collapse:collapse;\"><tr><td width=\"34\" style=\"width:34px\"><img src=\"../../../assets/mark-dark.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" style=\"display:block;border:0;width:24px;height:24px\" /></td><td style=\"font-size:13px;line-height:20px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:4px;color:#f4efe6\">ECLIPSE</td><td class=\"mono\" align=\"right\" style=\"font-family:'Geist Mono',Menlo,Consolas,monospace;font-size:11px;line-height:16px;letter-spacing:1.3px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#9a97a6\">Primer contacto · DentalOS</td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td  style=\"padding:0;background-color:#05050a;font-size:0;line-height:0\"><img src=\"../../../assets/art-hero.jpg\" alt=\"Eclipse total: la luna cubre el sol y deja ver la corona.\" width=\"640\" height=\"440\" style=\"display:block;border:0;outline:none;width:100%;max-width:640px;height:auto;background-color:#05050a;color:#9a97a6;font-family:Geist,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;\" /></td></tr><tr><td class=\"pad\" style=\"padding:56px 48px;background-color:#05050a;color:#f4efe6;padding-top:8px;padding-bottom:64px\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"  style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:auto;margin:0 0 28px\"><tr><td class=\"mono\" style=\"width:22px;font-family:'Geist Mono',Menlo,Consolas,monospace;font-size:11px;line-height:16px;color:#f4efe6;white-space:nowrap\">01</td><td aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"width:40px;padding:0 12px\"><div style=\"height:1px;line-height:1px;font-size:1px;background-color:#34333b\">&nbsp;</div></td><td aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"width:14px;padding-right:10px\"><img src=\"../../../assets/glyph-6-dark.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" style=\"display:block;border:0;width:14px;height:14px\" /></td><td class=\"mono\" style=\"font-family:'Geist Mono',Menlo,Consolas,monospace;font-size:11px;line-height:16px;letter-spacing:1.3px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#9a97a6\">Salud · consultorio odontológico</td></tr></table><h1 class=\"serif h1\" style=\"margin:0 0 28px;font-family:'Instrument Serif',Georgia,serif;font-size:60px;line-height:62px;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:-1.2px;color:#f4efe6;overflow-wrap:break-word\">Cada turno,<br>con su <em style=\"font-style:italic;font-weight:400;color:#f5b942\">próximo paso</em>.</h1><p style=\"margin:0 0 12px;font-size:18px;line-height:28px;color:#f4efe6;\">Hola, equipo de ",".</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 0px;font-size:18px;line-height:29px;color:#c9c4bc;\">Pensamos en consultorios como el tuyo y armamos una propuesta concreta: turnos en pocos pasos, una recepción con contexto y un seguimiento que no depende de la memoria.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 0px;font-size:12px;line-height:20px;color:#9a97a6;padding-top:28px\"><span class=\"mono\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:10px;background-color:#1a1a24;color:#9a97a6;font:600 10px/14px 'Geist Mono',Menlo,Consolas,monospace;letter-spacing:1.4px;text-transform:uppercase;white-space:nowrap\">Muestra</span>&nbsp; Ejemplo ficticio · apertura sectorial, sin investigación del negocio.</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"pad\" style=\"padding:56px 48px;background-color:#05050a;color:#f4efe6;padding-top:8px;padding-bottom:72px\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"  style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:auto;margin:0 0 28px\"><tr><td class=\"mono\" style=\"width:22px;font-family:'Geist Mono',Menlo,Consolas,monospace;font-size:11px;line-height:16px;color:#f4efe6;white-space:nowrap\">02</td><td aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"width:40px;padding:0 12px\"><div style=\"height:1px;line-height:1px;font-size:1px;background-color:#34333b\">&nbsp;</div></td><td aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"width:14px;padding-right:10px\"><img src=\"../../../assets/glyph-4-dark.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" style=\"display:block;border:0;width:14px;height:14px\" /></td><td class=\"mono\" style=\"font-family:'Geist Mono',Menlo,Consolas,monospace;font-size:11px;line-height:16px;letter-spacing:1.3px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#9a97a6\">El trailer</td></tr></table><h2 class=\"serif h2\" style=\"margin:0 0 20px;font-family:'Instrument Serif',Georgia,serif;font-size:46px;line-height:48px;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:-0.9px;color:#f4efe6;overflow-wrap:break-word\">DentalOS, en <em style=\"font-style:italic;font-weight:400;color:#f5b942\">60 segundos</em>.</h2><p style=\"margin:0 0 36px;font-size:17px;line-height:28px;color:#c9c4bc;\">Sesenta segundos de motion graphics, con música, que recorren todo DentalOS: lo que vive tu cliente, lo que ve tu equipo y cómo se conecta cada parte. Pensado para el celular y para la compu.</p><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"  style=\"border-collapse:collapse;margin:0 0 12px\"><tr><td class=\"mono\" style=\"font-family:'Geist Mono',Menlo,Consolas,monospace;font-size:11px;line-height:16px;letter-spacing:1.3px;color:#9a97a6\">TRAILER · 60 S</td><td class=\"mono\" align=\"right\" style=\"font-family:'Geist Mono',Menlo,Consolas,monospace;font-size:11px;line-height:16px;letter-spacing:1.3px;color:#f5b942\">MOTION GRAPHICS · CON MÚSICA</td></tr></table><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"  style=\"border-collapse:collapse;\"><tr><td aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" style=\"width:10px;height:10px;border-top:1px solid #34333b;border-left:1px solid #34333b;font-size:1px;line-height:1px\">&nbsp;</td><td aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"font-size:1px;line-height:1px\">&nbsp;</td><td aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" style=\"width:10px;height:10px;border-top:1px solid #34333b;border-right:1px solid #34333b;font-size:1px;line-height:1px\">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"font-size:1px;line-height:1px\">&nbsp;</td><td class=\"\" style=\"padding:0px;\"><img src=\"../../../assets/poster-dentalos-cliente-inicio.jpg\" alt=\"Póster de muestra del trailer de DentalOS\" width=\"544\" height=\"306\" style=\"display:block;border:0;outline:none;width:100%;max-width:544px;height:auto;background-color:#05050a;color:#9a97a6;font-family:Geist,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;\" /></td><td aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"font-size:1px;line-height:1px\">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" style=\"width:10px;height:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #34333b;border-left:1px solid #34333b;font-size:1px;line-height:1px\">&nbsp;</td><td aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"font-size:1px;line-height:1px\">&nbsp;</td><td aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" style=\"width:10px;height:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #34333b;border-right:1px solid #34333b;font-size:1px;line-height:1px\">&nbsp;</td></tr></table><p style=\"margin:0 0 4px;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;color:#9a97a6;padding:14px 10px 0\">Trailer pendiente de incorporar · el póster es una vista previa estática.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 0px;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;color:#9a97a6;padding:0 10px\">Ver cómo funciona · enlace disponible al incorporar el trailer.</p></td></tr><tr><td  style=\"padding:0;background-color:#0c0c14;font-size:0;line-height:0\"><img src=\"../../../assets/art-transition.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"320\" style=\"display:block;border:0;outline:none;width:100%;max-width:640px;height:auto;background-color:#0c0c14;color:#9a97a6;font-family:Geist,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;\" /></td></tr><tr><td class=\"pad\" style=\"padding:56px 48px;background-color:#fbf9f6;color:#111114;padding-top:24px\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"  style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:auto;margin:0 0 28px\"><tr><td class=\"mono\" style=\"width:22px;font-family:'Geist Mono',Menlo,Consolas,monospace;font-size:11px;line-height:16px;color:#111114;white-space:nowrap\">03</td><td aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"width:40px;padding:0 12px\"><div style=\"height:1px;line-height:1px;font-size:1px;background-color:#c4beb4\">&nbsp;</div></td><td aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"width:14px;padding-right:10px\"><img src=\"../../../assets/glyph-2-light.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" style=\"display:block;border:0;width:14px;height:14px\" /></td><td class=\"mono\" style=\"font-family:'Geist Mono',Menlo,Consolas,monospace;font-size:11px;line-height:16px;letter-spacing:1.3px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#5b5866\">En corto</td></tr></table><h2 class=\"serif h2\" style=\"margin:0 0 28px;font-family:'Instrument Serif',Georgia,serif;font-size:48px;line-height:50px;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:-1.0px;color:#111114;overflow-wrap:break-word\">La propuesta,<br>en tres líneas.</h2><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"  style=\"border-collapse:collapse;border-top:1px solid #111114\"><tr><td style=\"padding:14px 16px 14px 0;border-bottom:1px dotted #c4beb4;font-size:17px;line-height:24px;color:#111114;vertical-align:top;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word\">La demo<br><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:22px;color:#5b5866\">DentalOS, con datos ficticios</span></td><td class=\"mono\" align=\"right\" style=\"padding:14px 0;border-bottom:1px dotted #c4beb4;font-family:'Geist Mono',Menlo,Consolas,monospace;font-size:17px;line-height:24px;color:#111114;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top;text-align:right\"><a href=\"https://toti-gauna.github.io/DentalOS/#/\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#8a5a00;text-decoration:none\">ABRIR ↗</a></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:14px 16px 14px 0;border-bottom:1px dotted #c4beb4;font-size:17px;line-height:24px;color:#111114;vertical-align:top;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word\">Adaptación de producto<br><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:22px;color:#5b5866\">Incluye asesoría inicial de growth y retención</span></td><td class=\"mono\" align=\"right\" style=\"padding:14px 0;border-bottom:1px dotted #c4beb4;font-family:'Geist Mono',Menlo,Consolas,monospace;font-size:17px;line-height:24px;color:#111114;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top;text-align:right\">desde ARS 375.000 al contado<br><span style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:18px;color:#5b5866\">USD 250 · 50 % menos que USD 500</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:14px 16px 14px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #c4beb4;font-size:17px;line-height:24px;color:#111114;vertical-align:top;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word\">Plan mensual<br><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:22px;color:#5b5866\">Esencial gratis 3 meses; los demás, más baratos</span></td><td class=\"mono\" align=\"right\" style=\"padding:14px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #c4beb4;font-family:'Geist Mono',Menlo,Consolas,monospace;font-size:17px;line-height:24px;color:#111114;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top;text-align:right\">desde ARS 45.000/mes<br><span style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:18px;color:#5b5866\">USD 30/mes</span></td></tr></table><div aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"height:32px;line-height:32px;font-size:1px\">&nbsp;</d